================================================================
STYLE

- Quotes and paraphrases carry the content. Your own prose is
  scaffolding only.
- No introduction, no conclusion, no macro narrative.
- No repetition of the release figures beyond the header.
- Every voice traceable to a link.
- Honest gaps beat padded lists.

================================================================
FINAL DECISION RULE

When in doubt: open one more page looking for a name; label the
quote correctly; disclose what could not be verified; leave the
interpretation to the humans you quoted and to the downstream
agent.

